From 9984c493a3d07b10a01d10932c8a894b628b691b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: harvey186 <harvey186@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:25:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: make the dead settings actually work

Most settings on the settings page were saved but never read. A shared
settings hook now feeds them to the app and applies changes immediately:
hidden files, file extensions, markdown preview, animations,
notifications (errors always shown), sidebar width preset, and the
accessibility options, which were only applied after opening the
settings page. Auto Save had nothing to save and is removed.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GWWpEUAJotcDDNozkWrLi3
